    "description": "JVC MiniDV DVC Video Tapes Lot - 8 Pieces\nModel DVM60ME, 60 Minute SP / 90 Minute LP\nDigital Era\nThis lot features eight factory-sealed JVC MiniDV (DVC) digital video cassettes, designed for use with digital camcorders. These tapes were a staple of the consumer and enthusiast digital video transition in the late 1990s and early 2000s, offering high-quality digital recording on a compact magnetic medium. They remain essential for videographers maintaining vintage camcorder hardware or for those looking to record in a native digital-tape format.\nItems Included:\n1.\n8 JVC MiniDV Tapes\n- Model DVM60ME (also identified as M-DV60DU), 60-minute standard play capacity, factory-sealed.\nFormat: MiniDV / DVC Digital Video Cassette\nRecording Capacity: 60 minutes (SP mode) / 90 minutes (LP mode)\nAnti-static lid design for error-free recording\nMade in Japan\nCondition:\nAll eight tapes are new and factory-sealed in their original plastic wrap. The outer gold and blue cardstock packaging is intact with only minor shelf wear on the corners. As these are vintage magnetic media, long-term shelf stability is typical for the format, though they are sold as-is. Plastic wrap is tight and unopened across all units.",
